<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Stand Up, 2011</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; January 18th 2011 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Falkland Islands / Las Malvinas &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/B&gt; United Kingdom / Argentina &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 36 Hours&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Fighting an expensive land insurgency in southwest Asia has forced the UK Ministry of Defense to gut the Royal Navy and Royal Air Force faster than any likely adversary could ever hope to. The drawn out and unpopular conflict continues to stretch the MoD thin, while political machinations steadily erode the power projection capabilities of the Royal Navy.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;With internal strife brewing in Argentina, an old adversary sees an opportunity to better its position, renew a nationally important--and popular--claim and cement a win in the looming election. Will history repeat itself?&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
